.TH MY-COMMANDS 1 "September 2026" "dotbash-files" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
my-commands \- list commands provided by the user's Bash configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B my-commands
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B my-commands
prints an inventory of aliases, Bash functions, optional function modules, and
standalone commands installed in
.IR ~/.local/bin .
.PP
Aliases are read from
.IR ~/.bash_aliases .
Functions are read from
.I ~/.bash_functions
and
.IR ~/.bash_functions.d/*.bash .
Standalone commands are discovered in
.IR ~/.local/bin .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The inventory was displayed.
.TP
.B 2
Unexpected command-line arguments were supplied.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.bash_aliases
Shared aliases.
.TP
.I ~/.bash_functions
Shared Bash functions.
.TP
.I ~/.bash_functions.d/
Optional Bash function modules.
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/
Per-user executable commands.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bash (1),
.BR git (1)
